      "en": "`pd.merge(orders, customers, on=\"customer_id\", how=\"left\")` = week 18’s LEFT JOIN. `how=\"inner\"` keeps only matches. `validate=\"many_to_one\"` checks a customer is not duplicated (otherwise rows silently multiply). `pd.concat([jan, feb, mar])` stacks same-column tables (merging monthly files)."
